            <ArticleTitle>The First Gold(III) Formate: Evidence for β-Hydride Elimination.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>12862-12865</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/anie.201705557</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The first stable gold(III) formate and experimental evidence for its β-hydride elimination are described. A catalytic dehydrogenation of formic acid together with mechanistic studies shed light on potential pathways operating in fundamental gold-catalyzed transformations.</AbstractText>
